Test: gitgraph-no-duplicate-title >> invalid >>> docs/rules/gitgraph-no-duplicate-title.md incorrect 1
Filename: gitgraph-no-duplicate-title-incorrect-1.mmd

Code:
  1 | gitGraph
  2 |   title First
  3 |   title Second
    |   ^~~~~~~~~~~~ [1]
  4 |   commit
  5 |

[1] mermaid.js replaces the earlier title with the one of this `title`.
    Suggestions:
      - Remove this statement.
        Output:
          1 | gitGraph
          2 |   title First
          3 |   commit
          4 |
      - Remove the earlier statement that sets the title.
        Output:
          1 | gitGraph
          2 |   title Second
          3 |   commit
          4 |
---


